Stockfish 17.1 — Android build patch
====================================

Applies to: https://github.com/official-stockfish/Stockfish tag sf_17.1
File:       src/nnue/network.cpp

Why: the Android binary has to stay small (about 1 MB instead of ~76 MB).
     With NNUE_EMBEDDING_OFF the two NNUE networks are not compiled into the
     executable; the app downloads them at install time (see
     app/src/main/assets/engines/catalog.json). Stockfish reads them through
     the EvalFile / EvalFileSmall UCI options.

Note: the added line "// Netze werden nachgeladen, nicht eingebettet." is a
     source comment only ("networks are downloaded, not embedded") and has no
     effect on the compiled binary. It is kept verbatim so that this patch
     matches the source that libstockfish.so was actually built from.

The same change is applied by tools/build-stockfish.sh, which is what the
shipped binaries were built with.

--- a/src/nnue/network.cpp
+++ b/src/nnue/network.cpp
@@ -26,6 +26,8 @@
 #include <type_traits>
 #include <vector>
 
+// Netze werden nachgeladen, nicht eingebettet.
+#define NNUE_EMBEDDING_OFF
 #define INCBIN_SILENCE_BITCODE_WARNING
 #include "../incbin/incbin.h"
 
